msgstr "E-pos adres teruggestuur met die %E koekie in boodskap lêers."

#: Messages.cpp:19
msgid "If this is not checked, message files at CWD will be displayed only once."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie is nie nagegaan, boodskap lêers na Cwd sal wees vertoon slegs as "
"eers."

#: Messages.cpp:20
msgid "If this is not checked, hints on README files will be displayed only once."
msgstr ""
"As hierdie is nie nagegaan, leidrade op Leesmy lêers sal wees vertoon slegs "
"as eers."

#: Messages.cpp:22 Messages.cpp:23 Messages.cpp:24
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Messages are files that are automatically displayed to the user after "
"logging in or after entering a folder. Use the <b>Add Message</b> and "
"<b>Remove Message</b> buttons to modify the messages."
msgstr ""
"Boodskappe word lêers wat word automaties vertoon na die gebruiker na "
"afteken in of na in te tik 'n gids. Gebruik die <b>Voeg by Boodskap</b> en "
"<b>Verwyder Boodskap</b> knoppies na verander die Boodskappe."

#: Messages.cpp:26 Messages.cpp:27 Messages.cpp:28
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When you have defined README files, users changing to a folder containing "
"files matching the glob listed here will be pointed to these files with a "
