"\n"
"as hierdie is nie nagegaan, hulle sal net wees gewaarsku en gesê na gebruik "
"hulle\n"
"e-pos adres as wagwoord volgende tyd."

#: UserClasses.cpp:24
msgid ""
"User classes can be used to control access from specific hosts/users. Use "
"the <b>Add class</b> and <b>Delete class</b> buttons on the right of this "
"box to add or remove classes. Use the other buttons to control the access "
"rights of users in the class selected here."
msgstr ""
"Gebruiker klasse kan wees gebruik word na kontrole toegang verkry van "
"spesifieke bedieners/gebruikers. Gebruik die <b>Voeg by klas</b> en "
"<b>Uitvee klas</b> knoppies op die regterkant van hierdie boks na Voeg by "
"van verwyder klasse. Gebruik die ander knoppies na kontrole die toegang "
"verkry regte van gebruikers in die klas gekose hier."

#: UserClasses.cpp:25
msgid "Anonymous users (login=ftp or anonymous) can belong to this class"
msgstr "Anoniem gebruikers (aanteken=ftp of Anoniem) kan behoort na hierdie klas"

#: UserClasses.cpp:26
msgid "Guest users (restricted real users) can belong to this class"
msgstr "Gas gebruikers (beperking egte gebruikers) kan behoort na hierdie klas"

#: UserClasses.cpp:27
msgid "Real users can belong to this class"
msgstr "Egte gebruikers kan behoort na hierdie klas"

#: UserClasses.cpp:31
msgid "Add a new user class"
msgstr "Voeg by 'n nuwe gebruiker klas"

#: UserClasses.cpp:32
msgid "Delete the currently selected user class"
msgstr "Uitvee die huidiglik gekose gebruiker klas"

#: UserClasses.cpp:34 UserClasses.cpp:36
msgid ""
"Users from this class are automatically members\n"
"of the group selected here.\n"
"That way, you can (for example) grant local users\n"
"anonymous access to files remote users\n"
"can't download."
msgstr ""

#: UserClasses.cpp:44 UserClasses.cpp:45 UserClasses.cpp:49 UserClasses.cpp:50
#: UserClasses.cpp:51
